              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neisina oleng te nkaraki ilo rorei otejo eji, meitoki ae kata aadol enkomom enye. Neitarioo ninche ninye aaitabaiki enetii emeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
